  "configuration_id": "config_004",
  "reason": "RNA-only scvi_n200 with multiprofile is currently the strongest direction, with validation accuracy around 0.650-0.653 and F1 around 0.628. Multiprofile also clearly helped pca_n200, but it is still unclear whether scvi_n200 would perform well without multiprofile aggregation. config_004 tests scvi_n200 with singleprofile, changing only the profile/aggregation setting relative to the best RNA-only models, so it isolates the effect of profile setting while staying close to the current best evidence. This is a controlled, high-information experiment before adding the larger uncertainty of multimodal fusion."
}

